sequenceDiagram
    %% ogx-distribution data flows. Source: architecture/rhoai-3.7-ea.1/ogx-distribution.md
    participant Client as Client<br/>(notebook, app, agent)
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP (--insecure)
    participant JWKS as OIDC JWKS<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant LLM as vLLM / KServe or LLM API<br/>8000 or 443/TCP
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Files as Local FS or S3<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant VDB as Milvus / pgvector / Qdrant<br/>19530 / 5432 / 6333-6334

    Note over Client,PG: Flow 1: Chat completion / Responses request
    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/chat/completions or /v1/responses<br/>HTTP, no TLS at pod<br/>Optional Bearer JWT
    opt AUTH_ISSUER set (key refresh every 3600s)
        OGX->>JWKS: GET signing keys<br/>HTTPS TLS (AUTH_VERIFY_TLS)
        JWKS-->>OGX: JWKS
    end
    OGX->>LLM: OpenAI-compatible inference<br/>TLS for https URLs<br/>Bearer / API key / IAM
    LLM-->>OGX: Completion
    OGX->>PG: Store responses, inference log, conversations<br/>Password auth, driver-default TLS
    OGX-->>Client: JSON / SSE response

    Note over Client,VDB: Flow 2: RAG file ingestion and file search
    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/files (multipart)<br/>Optional Bearer JWT + owner ABAC
    OGX->>Files: Store blob<br/>localfs or S3 (AWS keys)
    OGX->>PG: File metadata
    OGX->>OGX: inline::auto file processor<br/>docling/pypdf models from .cache
    OGX->>LLM: Embeddings (VLLM_EMBEDDING_URL)<br/>Bearer
    LLM-->>OGX: Vectors
    OGX->>VDB: Insert chunks<br/>Optional TLS, token / password / API key
    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/responses with file_search
    OGX->>VDB: Vector search (inline::file-search)
    VDB-->>OGX: Matching chunks
    OGX->>LLM: Inference with retrieved context
    LLM-->>OGX: Completion
    OGX-->>Client: Response with citations
